# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NOCTRA — Docker build context
#
# Keep the context small and never ship secrets, local uploads, or
# development state inside the image.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Local environment and secrets — injected at runtime instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example
*.pem
*.key

# Virtualenvs and caches
venv
.venv
env
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.coverage

# Local data and uploads
media
app.bak
backups
*.sql
*.dump
*.log

# Tests and editor state are not needed in the runtime image
tests
.idea
.vscode

# Deployment configs are mounted into the nginx container, not the app
deploy/nginx
readme.md
